            <ArticleTitle>Prescription opioid guidelines and the emergency department.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>155-62</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3109/15360288.2013.788602</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>On January 10, 2013, Mayor Michael Bloomberg announced a set of recommendations intended to guide opioid analgesic prescribing in New York City emergency departments. The intent and scope of these guidelines are discussed through an interview by an emergency medicine fellow with an expert in emergency medicine pain management and one of the authors of the guidelines. The guidelines are appended to the commentary.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
